WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.347
What artists do.

2
00:00:01.507 --> 00:00:03.039
Artists do four things.

3
00:00:03.199 --> 00:00:05.614
They experience: they look, touch and try.

4
00:00:05.774 --> 00:00:09.675
They make: they mix, draw, join and build.

5
00:00:09.835 --> 00:00:12.436
They reflect: they look back and say what they like.

6
00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:16.264
And they think like artists: they have ideas and make things better.

7
00:00:16.424 --> 00:00:18.003
You did all four this year.

8
00:00:18.703 --> 00:00:19.725
A gallery.

9
00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:21.975
A gallery is a place to show art.

10
00:00:22.135 --> 00:00:23.853
The pictures hang in groups.

11
00:00:24.013 --> 00:00:25.546
Some are grouped by colour.

12
00:00:25.706 --> 00:00:27.610
Some are grouped by what they show.

13
00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:29.395
People walk past and look.

14
00:00:29.555 --> 00:00:30.948
They say what they like.

15
00:00:31.108 --> 00:00:33.523
Your class can make a gallery on a table.

16
00:00:34.223 --> 00:00:35.431
Making it better.

17
00:00:35.591 --> 00:00:38.006
Before a show, artists look at each piece.

18
00:00:38.166 --> 00:00:40.209
They make one change to make it better.

19
00:00:40.369 --> 00:00:42.180
That is not because it was bad.

20
00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:43.826
Nothing you made was bad.

21
00:00:43.986 --> 00:00:46.494
An artist can always see one more thing to try.

22
00:00:47.194 --> 00:00:48.262
Looking back.

23
00:00:48.422 --> 00:00:50.465
Your journal holds everything you made.

24
00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:51.926
Look back through it.

25
00:00:52.086 --> 00:00:55.290
Find your first line, your first mix and your first pattern.

26
00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:56.890
See how far you came!

27
00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:58.443
That is reflecting.

28
00:00:58.603 --> 00:01:00.553
It is the last thing an artist does.

29
00:01:00.713 --> 00:01:03.732
It is also the first thing before the next picture.
